# Phase 8.8: Docker images always run on Linux regardless of the host OS used for
# development. This repo is developed on Windows, where core.autocrlf=true rewrites
# LF to CRLF in the working directory on checkout — a CRLF shebang line breaks the
# interpreter inside a Linux container ("/bin/sh^M: bad interpreter"). Force these
# to stay LF on every platform so `docker build` (which reads the working directory,
# not the git blob) never sees CRLF here.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
